MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_Tia_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_Tia_m02_001: What a beautiful place... I imagine someone would\nget mad at me if I picked a flower.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c02_Tia_m02: <BLN>So beautiful!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_Pet_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_Pet_m02_001: It's so quiet and relaxing... I think I could stay right\nhere forever.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_Pet_m02_002: But then a guard would probably find me and get\nangry. I sure wouldn't like that.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c02_Pet_m02: <BLN>So relaxing...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_Cas_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_Cas_m02_001: This certainly brings back a memory or two...\nTime flies, and it doesn't come back.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c02_Cas_m02: <BLN>This brings back memories...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B01_m01_001: Whoa, look at your eyes. That golden color is pretty\nunusual, huh?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B01_m01_002: The story goes that the Divine Emperor who reigned\nso long ago had eyes that color too.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c02_B01_m01: <BLN>So unusual...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B02_m01_001: Mind your step, kid. Lots of bad people around here\njust looking to cause trouble.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B02_m01_002: The capital's full of the kind of scumbags who prey\non the innocent.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c02_B02_m01: <BLN>Mind your step...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B03_m01_001: The way you're gawking at everything, you must\nhave just come here from the countryside.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B03_m01_002: Understandable if you're a little overwhelmed. This\ncity's the very heart of the mighty Dagdan Empire!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c02_B03_m01: <BLN>Isn't the imperial capital splendid?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B04_m01_001: I heard the grown-ups talking about how a really\nhuge celebration's gonna start soon!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c02_B04_m01_002: It's so exciting! I can't wait! Oh, I wonder what kind\nof celebration it'll be?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c02_B04_m01: <BLN>A celebration's about to start!